<title>UK: C. Salvesen names post-demerger chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>C. Salvesen names post-demerger chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified distribution group Christian Salvesen said on Thursday that Jonathan Fry, its current deputy chairman, would become non-executive chairman after the demerger of its specialist hire purchase business.</p>
<p>Edward Roderick, the current managing director of the group's industrial logisitics division, will be the chief executive of the firm after the demerger.</p>
</text>
